<title>UK: TVA sets 1.5 billion mark 10-year bond, +16-18 bp.</title>
<headline>TVA sets 1.5 billion mark 10-year bond, +16-18 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Lehman Brothers Bankhaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TENNESSEE VALLEY AUTHORITY</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+16-18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRFT,NYSE PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
